  "prompt": "Operator: ApplyAdam in-place (non-Nesterov), float32. Inputs var,m,v,grad (same shape) + 6 host scalars folded into ConstExpr floats one_minus_beta1, one_minus_beta2, alpha=lr*sqrt(1-beta2_power)/(1-beta1_power), epsilon. Per element: m_new=m+(grad-m)*one_minus_beta1; v_new=v+(grad*grad-v)*one_minus_beta2; var_new=var-(m_new*alpha)/(sqrt(v_new)+epsilon). Store m_new,v_new,var_new in place. Input shapes: [16,2048],[32,4096]. Output: same_as_input. Layout contiguous; flatten to 1D in the host launcher; kernel takes `size:int` + ConstExpr scalars and tiles 1D. TILE_SIZE=2048, CORE_NUM=16; size multiple of TILE_SIZE*CORE_NUM=32768 (aligned_only); partition tile_per_core. Tolerance atol=1e-5, rtol=1e-4 vs NumPy. Platform Ascend950PR_9599. Build/run: python3.11 kernel.py -r Model -v Ascend950PR_9599.",
